            <details><summary>Is the design consultation really free?<span class="pm"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p>Yes. We visit your property, talk through what you want and follow up with a design and a detailed written quote. There's no charge and no obligation.</p></details>
            <details><summary>Do you design the project as well as build it?<span class="pm"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p>Yes. We plan your project around how you want to use the space and show you a 3D design and a written quote before anything is built.</p></details>
            <details><summary>What construction services do you offer?<span class="pm"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p>Landscape design, retaining walls, concrete, asphalt, Belgian block, concrete curbing, hardscape, rock and boulder installation, step installation, paver installation and sealing, planting, dry creek installation, outdoor kitchens, pergolas, stone veneer, stucco, masonry work, ponds and water features.</p></details>
            <details><summary>Do you work on commercial properties?<span class="pm"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p>Yes. We also handle small construction for commercial properties, including masonry, pavers, concrete, asphalt repair and fencing.</p></details>
            <details><summary>Are you licensed and insured?<span class="pm"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p>Yes, Euro Style Landscape is licensed and insured.</p></details>
            <details><summary>Which areas do you serve?<span class="pm"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p>We're based in Sayreville and work in towns across Middlesex, Monmouth and Union counties, including Old Bridge, East Brunswick, Woodbridge, Marlboro and Freehold.</p></details>
